Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.66,0:01:44.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(653,666)\fnPapyrus\fs60}The Inside Story!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.66,0:01:44.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(653,764)\fnPapyrus\fs60}A Drillmaster for the Swine!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, take a look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's oinky-doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.32,0:01:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.23,0:01:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear Ronko Menon just\Njoined their group.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.48,0:01:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.39,0:01:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who got busted 15 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's back working in Akiba? She is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:01:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as a novice maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.62,0:02:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been going around crushing\Nplaces ever since she joined.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.88,0:02:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we have ourselves a new war pig, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all created creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.56,0:02:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what is the creature\Nland group's purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The following three cafes get up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foxy Vixen Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.03,0:02:27.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devoted Maid Dog Cafe. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oinky Doink Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are three great attributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.84,0:02:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every maid in our group should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.20,0:02:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One is the ability to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.84,0:02:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.78,0:02:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another is the ability to make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you. I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.82,0:02:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, the most important attribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think we wouldn't notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're embezzling from the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.86,0:03:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to take the fall for this, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most important attribute to have is,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of course, loyalty toward\Nthe Creatureland group.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to enforce these attributes, we\Nwill be sending Drillmasters to each cafe.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.51,0:03:19.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(771.2,505.6)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Sows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do any of you know what\Nthis cafe is missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.64,0:03:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool vibes. Some craftiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.36,0:03:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kindness, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Steadfast resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A chief capable of running a kiffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Swine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.75,0:03:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our lack of maid-like activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chief is so right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.68,0:03:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've hardly done anything\Nmaid-like since I've come to Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.52,0:03:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The group is sending us a Drill\NMaster to straighten our asses up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a Drill Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're specialists in teaching\Nmaids how to properly run a cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumors are most maids get crushed\Nunder their hellish training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.03,0:03:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they get crushed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.18,0:04:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the Drill Master's here,\Nwe're gonna try real hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We always try real hard, chief.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.89,0:04:04.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540.8,694.4)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.64,0:04:06.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(718.4,853)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}The Day Before Training
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home to the pigsty, mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your masters are supposed to\Nwant to come home to a pigsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, this is just\Npart of our cafe theme.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a maid cafe, but it's\Nalso a pigsty. Ludicrous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.64,0:04:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Luda what? Oink?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the dispatch from the group Sano.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every single one of you fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The place is dirty, the\Ndecorations are half-assed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you are all over-reliant\Non your star employee,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even she gets away with stale service.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.78,0:04:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of you are so empty-headed\Nyou only know how to snort.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Above all, you have no\Nloyalty towards the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the sorriest maids I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.76,0:04:49.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(830,539.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}CREATURELAND
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.68,0:04:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, go re-educate all useless maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.80,0:04:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut off any maids you come\Nacross and deem too hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accept no failures in\Ntraining our creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life depends on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.30,0:05:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your training starts tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you pass the test within a week,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.92,0:05:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll report to the higher-ups that\Nyou're not a problem and need not be cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A test?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.28,0:05:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You each will be required to\Nsqueeze out at least 100,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that, piglets?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.16,0:05:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The benevolent Misano is giving\Nyou one last and final chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So get your heads in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You. Yes, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.20,0:05:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The group is cutting you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The panda two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are a bad influence on the maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are undisciplined.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're rotten apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, more like sickly pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but no, I'm a very healthy piggy boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying this out of kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or would you rather Creatureland\Ndisown you completely?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything but that.\NPlease leave. Yes, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not our chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting today and onwards, you will treat\Nme as if I am the Creatureland group.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:06:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reveille is at 5 a .m. That is all.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.55,0:06:04.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(760.4,859.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}Day One of Training
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.70,0:06:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi, it's time to get up. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.10,0:06:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not that adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.48,0:06:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.72,0:06:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, my mistress.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.49,0:06:23.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(706,868.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}5:30 A.M. ~ Morning Assembly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, my mistress!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Louder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.03,0:06:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, my mistress! I said louder!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.12,0:06:33.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(740.6,866.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}7:00 A.M. ~ Job Training
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totally out of sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do it again! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all done drawing, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.58,0:06:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, a kitty cat? Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.10,0:06:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.38,0:06:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think so, then draw it properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of that poor sweet omelette.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.77,0:06:55.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(727.8,865)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}12:00 P.M. ~ Café Opens
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One oinky-doink drink combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.04,0:06:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, oinky-doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, oinky-doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You. Yes, ma 'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.10,0:07:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is your head full of pig slop?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.16,0:07:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That much syrup can't possibly be\Nany good for the master's health.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying dilute it with more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with the right amount\Nbased on cost, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all you care about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Money, money, money?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.39,0:07:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, go ahead and comment on each\Nother's weaknesses. You can't
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.38,0:07:25.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(633.2,865)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}9:00 P.M. ~ Performance Review Meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.10,0:07:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think of any because You pigs can't\Nthink at all then let me start
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for you shipon hmm what's with\Nthat makeup it's not Appropriate
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the creature land group what\Ncan we at least wear makeup the way
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we ah Bitch this maid cafe is\Npart of the creature land group
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unless you change your whole\Nappearance you Won't be passing my test
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.65,0:07:48.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(681.4,869.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}0:00 A.M. ~ Teambuilding Exercise
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.49,0:07:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stuff huh what's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I expect you sows To make a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:08:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,carving of this in a week what\Ndoes that have to do with being a?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.50,0:07:59.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518.4,352.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}CREATURELAND
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.39,0:08:12.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.6,871.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}2:00 A.M. ~ Bedtime
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.18,0:08:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I turn out the lights\Nso we can go to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko, do you think being a maid is\Nabout working for her parent group?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.46,0:08:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's also an important factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.72,0:08:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So very hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, I've got some Baan leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.72,0:08:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to eat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you don't want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.94,0:08:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're human, after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.13,0:08:43.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(774.8,863.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}Day Two of Training
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you realize it's morning assembly time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're boycotting that today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.74,0:08:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you want to leave\Nthe Creatureland group?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just want a different Drillmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't think it's efficient to be\Ntrained by someone we don't agree with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.80,0:09:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been given full\Nauthority on this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the boss of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.26,0:09:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boycott! Boycott!\NBoycott! Boycott! Boycott!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.26,0:09:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please put that away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.74,0:09:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was all done for your own betterment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.42,0:09:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I suppose I must have\Ntaken the wrong approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.86,0:09:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.92,0:09:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with this change in attitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.72,0:09:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me talk to you\Nindividually before I go
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.14,0:09:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you still decide to kick me\Nout after that, I will comply.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think? Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.82,0:09:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we can at least listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what she wants to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi, take a good look at the\NCreatureland Group building.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.58,0:10:00.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(781,158.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}CREATURELAND
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.44,0:10:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think? Um, it's really\Nbig. Do you know what the relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.94,0:10:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is between the group and its\Nmaids uh no not really i see them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.58,0:10:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear on my life I won't\Nlet go of you. No! Pull me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.68,0:10:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our arms represent the relationship\Nbetween the group and its maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.02,0:10:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand? Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not how you answer! Yes! Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.30,0:10:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:10:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.56,0:11:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what it is you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.80,0:11:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This arm represents the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.66,0:11:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It protects its maids no\Nmatter how much it gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In return, maids squeeze out\Ntheir honey money for the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.60,0:11:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of supportive\Nrelationship we share together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.50,0:11:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right! Of course, madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She threw me off the town building!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's total crap, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.51,0:11:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the fuck, dudes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.98,0:11:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I admit the\Nstuff Miss Sano tells us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually pretty decent. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's not such a\Nbad person after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I would like to see what I\Ncan learn from her teachings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.06,0:11:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:12:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're gonna kick her out, right guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if we see how things go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.94,0:12:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might not be that bad. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you, Ronko?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it might be\Nworth the experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are y 'all for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.08,0:12:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smells so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crunchy part of the\Nchicken rice is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're totally scoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.85,0:12:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow us to see you off.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.51,0:12:25.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(794,866.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Day Three of Training
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow us to see you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your work attitude\Ngoing to be for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.14,0:12:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We work with gratitude for our group.\NYumechi. Yes. Yumechi. Yes. Yumechi. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.21,0:12:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes. Yumechi. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.18,0:12:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good job squeezing out the\Nhundred thousand for the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have anything to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am glad to have contributed\Nto the Creatureland group.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get complacent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you the star?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.92,0:12:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can squeeze out a lot more then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.78,0:12:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all of you, go and serve\Nyour little pig asses off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.18,0:12:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.94,0:12:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone else? Yes!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.76,0:13:02.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(643.2,875.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}9:00 P.M. ~ Performance Review Meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.82,0:12:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Zoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi wasn't insistent enough, and her\Nmaster left without ordering anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.21,0:13:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for your great comment!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Sano, please do your worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.98,0:13:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, Madam Creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.30,0:13:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shippon played hooky again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She missed today's practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.46,0:13:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Sano, I don't feel any\Nloyalty toward the group from her at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you guys...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.04,0:13:37.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(708.8,740.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}SHIIPON
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.00,0:13:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you now see the joy in working\Nfor that sweet honey money tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We start doing our best\Nfor the sake of the group
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Sano, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.10,0:14:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo, Shii-pon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out, come out, wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.74,0:14:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone makes mistakes now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.02,0:14:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shii-pon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.56,0:14:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open up! Come on, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronco!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.04,0:14:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can leave through here. What so you're\Ngonna let me go if that is what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you are you going to stay and\Nbe a maid all i care about is making sure i
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.80,0:15:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,protect This cafe what about you i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know i just kind of\Nfell into the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never stuck with other\Njobs in the past like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why was being a maid\Nthe one thing I kept doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.14,0:15:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.34,0:15:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a lot of fun just being a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what else is out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the oinky-doink I know anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.22,0:15:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.58,0:15:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.72,0:15:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ranko, on second thought,\NI still want to be a maid.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.14,0:15:54.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(864,605)\fnPapyrus\fs60}tureland
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.64,0:15:54.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(757.2,862)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}Day Four of Training
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:16:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting today, I'll work my heart\Nout for the sake of the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look much cuter that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It suits you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.48,0:16:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.18,0:16:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for assembly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.56,0:16:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the hundred thousand\NI made, Instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.42,0:16:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure made me wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.14,0:16:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Madam Creature!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.02,0:16:41.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(883.2,512)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Creatureland
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.40,0:16:43.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(770,855.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}Last Day of Training
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to announce the final results\Nof your maid training. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the sorriest bunch\Nof maids I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.74,0:16:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heads are full of slop, your dues\Nare overdue, and you always avoid work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of\Ndespicable maids you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.02,0:16:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:17:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, you are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.94,0:17:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every one of you passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.48,0:17:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maids don't cry that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.48,0:17:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.66,0:17:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look at the result of\Nyour teamwork to remind
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourselves that you are maids\Nin the Creatureland group.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.90,0:17:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm a creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.36,0:17:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.98,0:17:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so very much, Instructor Sano?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.30,0:17:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okachimachi
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're tired, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.48,0:17:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so very sleepy for some reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.30,0:17:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I really do anything wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:17:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always get my ass yelled at.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because they never earn\Nenough money for me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.26,0:18:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm getting pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for you sickly pigs to come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.74,0:18:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose to Yumechi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.64,0:18:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And have her rub it in my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.10,0:18:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That she's a better pig than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, what is it you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.08,0:18:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Order a song for me and I'll squeal\Nfor you Hey, Zoya, where's Shippan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she went for a stroll\Na little while ago Yumechi,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your face doesn't look too good, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.88,0:18:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to keep\Nworking on cutting costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To earn enough honey\Nmoney to pay her dues?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.94,0:18:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pig dicks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.52,0:18:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This shit ends right now! Uh-huh. Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And sheepon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.48,0:18:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The oink-y-doink belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you regret that\Nyou kicked me out on my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.24,0:18:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.15,0:18:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco, what are you doing? Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.40,0:19:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.58,0:19:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the out of your fucking mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi, stop her! I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shiba, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.52,0:19:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put that down!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.80,0:19:21.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(416.2,406.4)\fnPapyrus\fs50}Creatureland
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.58,0:19:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.66,0:19:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything but that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.46,0:19:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That represents the bond\Nbetween us and instructor Sada!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what we worked for!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sake of the group!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't fucking care!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is for the moments\Nthat are actually fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.58,0:19:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even in this smelly-ass pig shit town!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen up, you swine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it and come back!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.92,0:19:50.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(634,400)\fnPapyrus\fs50}Creatureland
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.94,0:20:13.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(790.4,852.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs50}A Few Days Later
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.07,0:20:15.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(500.8,688)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.52,0:20:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that damn panda here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.08,0:20:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okachimachi, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yummy bamboo leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.64,0:20:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chief, you went and ate\Na parfait again, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.38,0:20:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hid the one as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.36,0:20:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too, Zoya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're back where they started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you coming or going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.20,0:20:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like, make up your mind already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.66,0:20:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.38,0:20:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mistress, I'm very sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there are other masters present.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so could you kindly vacate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you about\Nthat hideous makeup?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look good on you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.14,0:20:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My makeup's the bomb just the\Nway it is, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't matter anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've gone too far this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got some handsome masters\Nin here, so keep it down, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Sano, you can't go\Nslapping sheep on like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accept no failures in\Ntraining our creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life depends on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.14,0:21:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm responsible for all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.30,0:21:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.92,0:21:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, disowned. Even.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow us to see you off, mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These strokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice stop and flick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nogomi. Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.24,0:21:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've gotten better at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.14,0:21:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:21:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi Wahira, age 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.74,0:22:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having loads of fun and\Nlearning a lot as a cute maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.92,0:22:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sheepon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.40,0:22:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being a maid sure is a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.68,0:22:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You totally got that right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.62,0:22:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today and tomorrow,\NI'll be angry with you.
